# program (prelude alias for builtin-program) resolves to a Builtin value.
# Documents are internal runtime values that cannot be constructed from user code,
# so we cannot call program() with valid arguments in a corpus test.
# This test verifies the name is bound and callable (arity check fires, not undefined-var).
[type-of program]
=== out
String("Function")

=== warn
cannot unify Top with <error> at 4:10-4:17
